                <td width=777 valign=center colspan=14 style="width:466.7000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-left-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;
border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border-color: #ccc; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 1453px; width: 1013px;" border="1" width="695">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 38.0729px; height: 10px;">
<p><strong>周次</strong></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 268.396px; height: 10px;">
<p><strong>教学内容</strong></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 584.615px; height: 10px;">
<p><strong>教学目标</strong></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 67.0417px; height: 10px;">
<p><strong>授课教师</strong></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 38.0729px; height: 10px;">
<p>1</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 268.5px; height: 10px;">
<p>临床肿瘤学进展概论/内科治疗进展</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 584.771px; height: 10px;">
<p>掌握肿瘤学整体发展脉络与内科治疗核心进展，理解内科治疗在肿瘤综合诊疗中的定位。</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 67.0625px; height: 10px;">
<p>刘天舒</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 38.0625px; height: 93px;">
<p>2</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 268.521px; height: 93px;">
<p>肿瘤分子病理学进展</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 584.812px; height: 93px;">
<p>明晰肿瘤分子病理的核心机制与研究进展，理解其指导肿瘤精准诊疗的底层逻辑。</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 67.0833px; height: 93px;">
<p>侯英勇</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 38.0625px; height: 93px;">
<p>3</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 268.531px; height: 93px;">
<p>肿瘤临床检验及液体活检</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 584.823px; height: 93px;">
<p>掌握肿瘤临床常规检验指标意义及液体活检技术原理，了解其在肿瘤早筛与疗效监测中的应用价值。</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 67.0833px; height: 93px;">
<p>郭玮</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 38.0625px; height: 93px;">
<p>4</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 268.521px; height: 93px;">
<p>肿瘤的影像学检查</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 584.833px; height: 93px;">
<p>熟悉肿瘤影像学检查的前沿技术与诊断要点，学会区分不同影像手段在肿瘤诊疗中的适用场景。</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 67.0833px; height: 93px;">
<p>石洪成</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 38.0625px; height: 93px;">
<p>5</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 268.521px; height: 93px;">
<p>肿瘤的外科学治疗进展</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 584.833px; height: 93px;">
<p>掌握肿瘤外科微创化、精准化发展趋势，理解外科治疗与其他疗法联合应用的策略逻辑。</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 67.0833px; height: 93px;">
<p>汪学非</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 38.0625px; height: 93px;">
<p>6</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 268.521px; height: 93px;">
<p>肿瘤的放射治疗进展</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 584.833px; height: 93px;">
<p>了解放疗技术的革新方向，掌握放疗在肿瘤根治性与姑息性治疗中的应用原则。</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 67.0833px; height: 93px;">
<p>杜世锁</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 38.0625px; height: 93px;">
<p>7</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 268.521px; height: 93px;">
<p>肿瘤的介入治疗进展</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 584.833px; height: 93px;">
<p>熟悉肿瘤介入治疗的核心技术类型，理解介入治疗在中晚期肿瘤局部治疗中的优势与应用指征。</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 67.0833px; height: 93px;">
<p>瞿旭东</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 38.0625px; height: 93px;">
<p>8</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 268.521px; height: 93px;">
<p>肿瘤的内镜治疗进展</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 584.833px; height: 93px;">
<p>掌握内镜在肿瘤诊断与微创治疗中的进展，了解内镜技术与其他疗法协同应用的临床价值。</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 67.0833px; height: 93px;">
<p>周平红</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 38.0625px; height: 93px;">
<p>9</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 268.521px; height: 93px;">
<p>肿瘤免疫治疗进展</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 584.833px; height: 93px;">
<p>掌握免疫治疗的作用机制与代表性药物，理解免疫治疗在不同肿瘤类型中的疗效特点与生物标志物意义。</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 67.0833px; height: 93px;">
<p>周宇红</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 38.0625px; height: 93px;">
<p>10</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 268.521px; height: 93px;">
<p>肿瘤靶向治疗进展</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 584.833px; height: 93px;">
<p>熟悉靶向治疗的分类与作用靶点，掌握靶向药物的临床应用原则及耐药性应对策略。</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 67.0833px; height: 93px;">
<p>崔越宏</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 38.0625px; height: 41px;">
<p>11</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 268.521px; height: 41px;">
<p>肿瘤内分泌治疗进展</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 584.833px; height: 41px;">
<p>掌握肿瘤内分泌治疗的核心原理与适用瘤种，理解内分泌治疗与其他疗法联合的优化方案。</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 67.0833px; height: 41px;">
<p>艾罗燕</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 38.0625px; height: 45px;">
<p>12</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 268.521px; height: 45px;">
<p>肿瘤姑息治疗进展</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 584.833px; height: 45px;">
<p>树立肿瘤姑息治疗的全周期理念，掌握姑息治疗在缓解患者症状、改善生存质量中的核心措施。</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 67.0833px; height: 45px;">
<p>徐 蓓</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 38.0625px; height: 93px;">
<p>13</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 268.521px; height: 93px;">
<p>肿瘤细胞治疗进展</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 584.833px; height: 93px;">
<p>了解细胞治疗（如 CAR-T）的技术原理与研发进展，明晰其在血液肿瘤及实体瘤中的应用现状与挑战。</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 67.0833px; height: 93px;">
<p>李伟</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 38.0625px; height: 51px;">
<p>14</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 268.521px; height: 51px;">
<p>新型抗肿瘤药物的研发过程</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 584.833px; height: 51px;">
<p>掌握新型抗肿瘤药物从靶点发现到临床试验的完整流程，理解药物研发中的关键技术节点与评价标准。</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 67.0833px; height: 51px;">
<p>徐晓晶</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 38.0625px; height: 52px;">
<p>15</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 268.521px; height: 52px;">
<p>肿瘤临床研究介绍</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 584.833px; height: 52px;">
<p>熟悉肿瘤临床研究的类型（如 Ⅰ-Ⅳ 期临床试验）与设计要点，理解临床试验在推动肿瘤治疗进展中的核心作用。</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 67.0833px; height: 52px;">
<p>余一祎</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 38.0625px; height: 21px;">
<p>16</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 268.521px; height: 21px;">
<p>临床肿瘤学指南介绍和解读</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 584.833px; height: 21px;">
<p>学会检索与解读主流肿瘤诊疗指南，掌握指南推荐意见的循证医学依据及临床转化方法。</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 67.0833px; height: 21px;">
<p>王妍</p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></font></span><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
